# Packages (`packages/**`)

| Package            | Role                                                        |
| ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------- |
| `@gloaming/shared` | Cross-app constants/types/policy for **2+** apps — no ORM   |
| `@gloaming/db`     | Drizzle schema + migrations SSOT (Better Auth + app tables) |

Follow the package and ownership boundaries in `AGENTS.md`.

## TypeScript

- Extend `../../tsconfig.base.json`; local `rootDir`/`include` as needed
- Source-first package: `exports` → `src/*.ts`, `tsc --noEmit` only (no `dist` / `build`)
- Cross-package: `@gloaming/*` names, not relative across packages
- Packages use `allowImportingTsExtensions` + `noEmit`; ESLint enforces import suffixes.

## Ownership

- Password/username/mail-cooldown policy SSOT → `@gloaming/shared/auth/policy`
- Cross-app validators/types → `@gloaming/shared`
- Persistence → `@gloaming/db` (Drizzle), not `@gloaming/shared` and not inline in `apps/backend`
- No Nest/React feature workflows in packages
- Do not add to `@gloaming/shared` for a single consumer

## Zod

When shared Zod is needed: monorepo **Zod v4**; import from `'zod'` only — not `'zod/v4'`. No `zod@3`.

## Do not

- App aliases in root `tsconfig.base.json`
- Secrets / env-specific compose in packages
- Duplicate cross-app policy/constants in `apps/*`
